OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                        G11/22
OL,2,V55555555CMONGOLIAN PARTY
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CPOLITBURO RESIGNS
OL,5, The entire Mongolian Communist Party
OL,6, Politburo has given in to opposition
OL,7, pressure and resigned, according to
OL,8, the Soviet news agency Tass.
OL,10, It reported from the capital, Ulan
OL,11, Bator, that the resignation was
OL,12, announced at a plenary session of
OL,13, the policy-making Central Committee.
OL,15, The country's leader, Jambyn Batmonh,
OL,16, said the Party must renew itself to
OL,17, keep faith with the masses.
OL,19, The East German news agency ADN quoted
OL,20, Batmonh as saying he would propose
OL,21, amending a constitutional clause
OL,22, guaranteeing the party's leading role.
OL,23,F]DFrom 12-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
